WEBVTT

01:40.040 --> 01:40.920
Slowly.

01:42.640 --> 01:43.480
One more step.

01:46.320 --> 01:47.480
Be careful.

01:53.640 --> 01:54.680
Thank you, Brother-in-law.

02:07.880 --> 02:09.080
Why are you calling him that?

02:09.160 --> 02:11.480
During this time, Duke Su has been helping

02:11.560 --> 02:13.520
with my necessities and even my treatment.

02:13.600 --> 02:15.240
Who is he if not my brother-in-law?

02:15.320 --> 02:16.160
You're promising,

02:16.880 --> 02:18.480
much smarter than your sister.

02:20.080 --> 02:20.920
Duke Su.

02:21.640 --> 02:23.400
Why did you come

02:23.480 --> 02:24.520
to see me today?

02:24.600 --> 02:26.520
We'll talk about that later.

02:26.600 --> 02:28.720
I'll have a walk
with my brother-in-law first.

02:29.920 --> 02:30.920
Don't worry.

02:31.480 --> 02:32.840
I'm very gentle.

02:43.560 --> 02:44.400
Brother-in-law.

02:44.480 --> 02:45.320
Slow down.

02:54.520 --> 02:56.520
PRINCESS WANNING'S MANSION

03:08.000 --> 03:08.880
Meixiang.

03:12.480 --> 03:13.320
Your Highness.

03:13.400 --> 03:15.320
What kind of incense is burning here?

03:15.880 --> 03:18.120
It's Your Highness' favorite, jasmine.

03:19.080 --> 03:20.480
Why does it smell so disgusting?

03:21.480 --> 03:23.920
Your Highness, Imperial Physician Zhang
will be here soon.

03:24.000 --> 03:25.360
After he arrives,

03:25.440 --> 03:27.120
he will prescribe some medicine.

03:27.200 --> 03:28.880
I will decoct it

03:28.960 --> 03:31.280
and you will feel better after taking it.

03:31.840 --> 03:33.440
Have you told Shen Yurong

03:34.400 --> 03:35.720
that I'm not feeling well?

03:35.800 --> 03:37.120
I have.

03:37.880 --> 03:38.840
What did he say?

03:39.400 --> 03:42.080
He told me to take care of Your Highness.

03:57.040 --> 03:58.440
How am I doing?

04:01.040 --> 04:03.040
Why aren't you saying anything?

04:05.880 --> 04:08.880
Your Highness, I may be mistaken.

04:08.960 --> 04:11.240
Please look for a better physician,
Your Highness.

04:18.839 --> 04:21.160
I only trust you
in the whole Imperial Academy of Medicine.

04:22.360 --> 04:24.680
Come on, tell me what's going on.

04:25.240 --> 04:28.240
Otherwise, I will punish you
for deceiving me.

04:28.960 --> 04:30.080
Spare my life, Your Highness.

04:30.160 --> 04:31.600
Please spare me, Your Highness.

04:31.680 --> 04:32.600
Raise your head.

04:35.360 --> 04:38.640
Have you menstruated this month,
Your Highness?

04:40.560 --> 04:41.880
I'm afraid Your Highness is…

04:42.600 --> 04:43.480
pregnant.

04:45.000 --> 04:46.240
How bold of you

04:46.320 --> 04:47.800
to speak nonsense
in front of Her Highness!

04:47.880 --> 04:49.760
I would not dare to do so!

04:49.840 --> 04:50.800
Have mercy, Your Highness.

04:51.280 --> 04:52.120
Spare me, Your Highness.

04:52.200 --> 04:53.800
Have mercy, Your Highness.

04:59.560 --> 05:00.560
Imperial Physician Zhang.

05:01.800 --> 05:03.440
Is what you said true?

05:04.080 --> 05:05.360
I dare not lie.

05:07.720 --> 05:09.680
Have you forgotten
the diagnosis you gave me

05:09.760 --> 05:11.120
when I returned from Dai?

05:15.360 --> 05:17.480
Your Highness has suffered
too many injuries.

05:18.760 --> 05:21.040
And having multiple miscarriages

05:21.840 --> 05:24.560
impaired your qi and blood
and blocked your meridians.

05:25.040 --> 05:27.960
It will be difficult for you
to recover from that.

05:28.520 --> 05:29.800
I'm afraid

05:30.760 --> 05:33.240
Your Highness can't bear
any more children in the future.

05:38.080 --> 05:40.840
That's why I was extremely surprised.

05:40.920 --> 05:43.440
This is extremely rare.

05:43.960 --> 05:46.880
It is truly a blessing from the heavens.

05:46.960 --> 05:49.240
It's like a miracle.

05:49.800 --> 05:51.320
If I don't want this child,

05:53.520 --> 05:55.160
can I get pregnant again in the future?

05:55.640 --> 05:56.720
Well,

05:56.800 --> 06:00.400
it's hard to say
if you will be this lucky again.

06:01.040 --> 06:04.360
How long do you think
I have been pregnant?

06:05.040 --> 06:07.920
It should be less than a month.

06:23.640 --> 06:25.560
Thank you for your hard work,
Physician Zhang.

06:27.320 --> 06:29.080
Take Imperial Physician Zhang

06:29.160 --> 06:31.200
to have some tea before leaving.

06:31.800 --> 06:32.640
No.

06:33.120 --> 06:35.760
I won't trouble you, Your Highness.

06:35.840 --> 06:37.720
I am in a hurry to go home.

06:37.800 --> 06:39.360
It's just a cup of tea.

06:39.440 --> 06:42.080
Your wife and son won't mind.

06:42.840 --> 06:45.360
Your Highness, please spare me!

06:45.440 --> 06:46.520
Your Highness!

06:47.120 --> 06:48.840
Your Highness, have mercy!

06:49.400 --> 06:50.240
Your Highness!

06:50.320 --> 06:51.600
Your Highness, spare my life!

06:52.080 --> 06:53.000
Your Highness!

06:53.960 --> 06:55.760
Your Highness, please spare me!

06:57.360 --> 06:59.080
Your Highness!

07:05.480 --> 07:07.400
I'm leaving for Great Zhao tonight.

07:09.120 --> 07:09.960
Already?

07:10.440 --> 07:11.600
To see your show,

07:11.680 --> 07:13.000
I've already delayed it for a day.

07:16.840 --> 07:18.960
Is there any news
from the Eldest Princess' Mansion?

07:19.040 --> 07:21.400
The Eldest Princess
secretly got rid of an imperial physician.

07:22.320 --> 07:24.200
It is said that she was diagnosed
to be pregnant.

07:25.360 --> 07:26.400
How did you do it?

07:26.480 --> 07:28.880
I remember that you know
how to check pulses.

07:28.960 --> 07:30.880
Being sick for a while
has taught me a thing or two.

07:31.480 --> 07:32.400
Check my pulse.

07:38.480 --> 07:39.560
Whose is it?

07:40.720 --> 07:41.920
I'm asking you.

07:43.480 --> 07:44.520
Jiuyue's.

07:44.600 --> 07:46.440
I told you she is a poison user.

07:46.520 --> 07:48.160
I know she uses poison.

07:48.680 --> 07:50.360
If I didn't try it on myself,

07:50.440 --> 07:51.560
how would I know if it works?

07:51.640 --> 07:54.360
Other than a false pulse,
what harm does this do?

07:54.440 --> 07:55.960
None.

07:56.520 --> 07:58.960
Jiuyue experimented this on herself
not long ago

07:59.040 --> 08:00.480
and I just happened to hear about it.

08:00.560 --> 08:01.560
This is ridiculous.

08:01.640 --> 08:02.920
It's not.

08:03.000 --> 08:04.880
Wanning may not want me
to marry Shen Yurong.

08:05.920 --> 08:08.240
If news about her pregnancy spreads now,

08:08.320 --> 08:09.680
I might be able to get out of this.

08:11.880 --> 08:13.360
Why are you staring at me?

08:14.040 --> 08:15.120
In front of Wanning,

08:15.920 --> 08:17.360
Shen Yurong can't protect you,

08:18.040 --> 08:19.080
but I can.

08:25.200 --> 08:26.040
I know.

08:27.440 --> 08:29.160
How did you poison the Eldest Princess?

08:30.000 --> 08:31.120
Wanning is wary of me,

08:31.880 --> 08:33.600
but she won't have her guard up
against Your Highness for now.

08:34.600 --> 08:37.720
I want to drug her
on your birthday banquet, Your Highness.

08:37.799 --> 08:38.960
What drug?

08:39.039 --> 08:40.520
It's not a harmful poison.

08:41.320 --> 08:43.240
It's just a drug
that can fake a pregnancy.

08:43.320 --> 08:44.760
After a while,

08:44.840 --> 08:46.480
the drug's effects
will wear off naturally.

08:46.560 --> 08:48.080
You are truly audacious.

08:50.040 --> 08:53.080
It's all thanks to you
for finding Consort Li's weakness.

08:53.840 --> 08:55.440
That's how I convinced her to help me.

09:03.640 --> 09:05.680
Now that granting the marriage
is no longer a problem,

09:05.760 --> 09:07.480
are you still going ahead with your plan?

09:08.480 --> 09:09.400
Of course.

09:10.080 --> 09:11.360
I want people to know

09:11.440 --> 09:13.920
about Wanning and Shen Yurong.

09:14.920 --> 09:17.040
I also want to help you
catch Prince Cheng's underlings.

09:17.120 --> 09:20.120
Shen Yurong won't let her do this.

09:20.200 --> 09:21.440
This is not up to him.

09:21.520 --> 09:23.040
Before I come back,

09:23.640 --> 09:25.880
remember to act cautiously then.

09:25.960 --> 09:27.120
If there's any problem,

09:27.200 --> 09:28.680
get Zhao Ke to send me a letter

09:28.760 --> 09:30.560
or wait until I'm back
before making a decision.

09:31.480 --> 09:33.000
I got it, Duke Su.

09:33.840 --> 09:35.040
I'm not that weak.

09:35.120 --> 09:37.760
I know how capable you are.

09:38.480 --> 09:39.600
Before you go,

09:40.160 --> 09:42.120
I want to thank you.

09:42.960 --> 09:44.720
Thank you for bringing me back
to the capital.

09:45.280 --> 09:48.560
Thank you for not abandoning me,
your pawn,

09:50.120 --> 09:51.840
from the beginning to the end.

09:53.040 --> 09:54.880
I've almost achieved my goal now.

09:55.440 --> 09:56.760
It's time for me to repay you.

09:59.440 --> 10:00.520
Do you still remember

10:01.760 --> 10:04.440
what I said to you
when you took the Annual Exam?

10:04.520 --> 10:07.600
I wish you a smooth journey ahead
and a successful revenge.

10:08.200 --> 10:10.440
Now, let me add this.

10:12.680 --> 10:16.240
I hope that you can live life
the way you want to.

10:46.160 --> 10:47.480
Are you setting off soon?

10:47.560 --> 10:48.440
Yes.

10:49.160 --> 10:50.160
Just do your best.

10:52.640 --> 10:54.240
Do you remember your father's funeral?

11:01.520 --> 11:02.360
GENERAL XIAO'S MEMORIAL TABLET

11:02.440 --> 11:05.680
Master, from now on,
I will be stationed at the northern border

11:06.760 --> 11:08.480
and inherit your responsibilities,

11:08.560 --> 11:10.120
guarding and defending our nation.

11:11.920 --> 11:12.760
One day,

11:13.760 --> 11:16.560
I will personally lead an army
to regain the lost territory

11:16.640 --> 11:17.800
and avenge you.

11:20.080 --> 11:21.280
GENERAL XIAO'S MEMORIAL TABLET

11:28.880 --> 11:30.160
Am I the only one who thinks

11:30.760 --> 11:32.280
that his crying looks fake?

11:32.360 --> 11:33.720
I think so too.

11:33.800 --> 11:36.240
Your father is dead.
Why aren't you crying?

11:36.320 --> 11:37.640
Father told me

11:38.320 --> 11:40.760
that if he dies in battle,

11:41.520 --> 11:43.000
I should see him off with a smile.

11:43.840 --> 11:45.320
But you aren't smiling either.

11:45.400 --> 11:48.040
Maybe he didn't die in battle.

11:48.120 --> 11:49.040
Do you want to investigate it?

11:49.760 --> 11:51.000
Will you let me investigate it?

11:56.200 --> 11:57.480
There are a few more people.

11:57.560 --> 11:58.400
Look into it for me.

12:08.280 --> 12:09.960
Don't you want to investigate me first?

12:13.280 --> 12:14.120
Give me your hand.

12:18.400 --> 12:19.240
The other hand.

12:21.000 --> 12:21.880
Close your eyes.

12:31.280 --> 12:32.440
I can see through you.

12:33.360 --> 12:34.600
How childish.

12:37.400 --> 12:38.840
I've trusted you for eight years.

12:40.040 --> 12:41.520
I will always trust you.

12:47.040 --> 12:48.040
Go and come back early.

12:48.120 --> 12:49.640
I'll be waiting for you in the capital.

13:20.600 --> 13:23.480
DAI CAMP

13:24.040 --> 13:25.560
Your Majesty, have some fruits.

13:25.640 --> 13:26.600
Sure.

13:26.680 --> 13:28.520
Don't you like dancing?

13:29.320 --> 13:30.320
Dance.

13:30.400 --> 13:31.240
Dance.

13:37.440 --> 13:38.920
EMPEROR OF DAI

13:39.000 --> 13:42.800
It seems like you want me
to dance with you.

13:46.200 --> 13:47.080
Will you dance or not?

13:47.160 --> 13:48.320
Will you dance or not?

15:18.640 --> 15:19.640
What a worthless princess.

15:20.520 --> 15:22.080
Already sent here as a hostage,

15:22.880 --> 15:24.640
yet she still doesn't know her place.

15:25.920 --> 15:27.000
Starting today,

15:27.520 --> 15:28.560
you will be

15:28.640 --> 15:30.040
the lowliest concubine

15:30.120 --> 15:31.680
in my tent.

15:32.240 --> 15:35.920
Someone, take her to the sheepfold.

15:36.560 --> 15:40.080
That will be her home from now on.

17:13.880 --> 17:16.359
This is extremely rare.

17:17.040 --> 17:19.680
It is truly a blessing from the heavens.

17:20.440 --> 17:21.960
If I don't want this child,

17:23.800 --> 17:25.319
can I get pregnant again in the future?

17:25.960 --> 17:27.480
It's hard to say

17:28.040 --> 17:29.520
if you will be this lucky again.

17:35.960 --> 17:36.800
Your Highness,

17:36.880 --> 17:39.320
Imperial Physician Zhang's family
has been dealt with too.

17:39.400 --> 17:41.200
What do you plan to do next?

17:41.280 --> 17:42.240
Plan about what?

17:42.320 --> 17:43.280
Do you plan

17:44.360 --> 17:45.560
to keep this child?

17:58.400 --> 17:59.440
You cheap servant.

17:59.520 --> 18:01.480
You're in no position to comment
on the baby in my belly.

18:01.560 --> 18:03.960
Your Highness' belly will grow day by day.

18:04.040 --> 18:05.880
It can't be hidden forever.

18:05.960 --> 18:08.040
If His Majesty or others discover this,

18:08.120 --> 18:09.520
I'm afraid we can't explain it.

18:10.040 --> 18:11.920
Your Highness love that man
with all your heart.

18:12.000 --> 18:13.040
If this is discovered,

18:13.120 --> 18:15.200
His Majesty will surely
not let this slide.

18:15.840 --> 18:17.640
If he finds out this is that man's child,

18:17.720 --> 18:19.520
I'm afraid his career will be ruined too.

18:19.600 --> 18:21.480
It will break your heart, Your Highness.

18:21.560 --> 18:23.840
But this is our child.

18:27.280 --> 18:28.240
I want to keep it.

18:29.200 --> 18:30.680
As for the next step,

18:31.240 --> 18:32.280
I'm not in a hurry.

18:33.080 --> 18:35.400
The child in my belly
is less than a month old now.

18:35.480 --> 18:36.800
No one will notice it yet.

18:37.360 --> 18:38.520
The most urgent task now

18:40.280 --> 18:42.520
is to take good care
of the child in my belly.

18:43.680 --> 18:45.440
We can't truly know people's intentions.

18:45.520 --> 18:48.000
There are countless people
who'd harm the child in my belly.

18:48.760 --> 18:50.120
I have to protect the child well.

18:50.680 --> 18:52.720
I will keep your child safe.

18:52.800 --> 18:54.280
Summon Shen Yurong quickly.

18:54.840 --> 18:56.680
- Now.
- Yes.

19:26.760 --> 19:28.040
Weapons down.

19:35.080 --> 19:37.200
OVERFLOWING WITH LUCK AND KINDNESS

19:52.480 --> 19:54.840
Even insects know they should climb up,

19:56.600 --> 19:57.960
let alone humans.

19:59.080 --> 20:02.120
Some people are born at the peak.

20:02.680 --> 20:05.120
Even if you prepared long and hard
for something,

20:05.200 --> 20:08.840
one can just throw out something randomly
to replace it.

20:13.240 --> 20:14.480
The heavens,

20:15.480 --> 20:16.880
you're so unfair.

20:17.960 --> 20:19.680
Must a person of humble origin

20:21.280 --> 20:23.040
live a lowly life?

20:28.240 --> 20:29.200
Mr. Shen.

20:29.280 --> 20:31.360
The Eldest Princess is summoning you
to her mansion.

20:31.920 --> 20:33.600
Why did she let you summon me in person?

20:44.000 --> 20:44.920
Pregnant?

20:46.120 --> 20:47.120
Could it be a mistake?

20:48.400 --> 20:49.880
Imperial Physician Zhang diagnosed it.

20:50.360 --> 20:51.200
It can't be wrong.

20:54.520 --> 20:55.440
Are you displeased?

20:56.600 --> 20:57.720
Are you still angry with me?

20:58.480 --> 20:59.800
With Your Highness' condition now,

21:00.600 --> 21:01.920
how can I still be angry?

21:02.000 --> 21:04.640
This child is a precious gift.

21:05.560 --> 21:07.560
You'll be my Prince Consort
sooner or later anyway.

21:08.960 --> 21:11.040
Now, we are just marrying
earlier than scheduled.

21:11.120 --> 21:12.840
I will ask His Majesty
to grant our marriage.

21:17.480 --> 21:18.560
Aren't Your Highness worried

21:19.040 --> 21:20.680
that if you ask to grant our marriage now,

21:21.480 --> 21:24.280
others will think that you're having
a secret affair with me?

21:24.840 --> 21:25.960
I don't care.

21:26.040 --> 21:28.440
But I can't ignore your reputation,
Your Highness.

21:31.440 --> 21:32.480
My reputation?

21:33.240 --> 21:34.800
Do you think I care about my reputation?

21:35.360 --> 21:36.440
Maybe I did before.

21:37.400 --> 21:39.120
- Since I came back from Dai--
- Your Highness.

21:41.560 --> 21:43.240
All right, I will say no more.

21:44.080 --> 21:45.920
I just want the baby in my belly

21:46.000 --> 21:47.600
to have a legitimate father.

21:52.520 --> 21:54.040
This is also my first child.

21:54.680 --> 21:56.760
I also hope to be its legitimate father.

21:57.560 --> 21:59.360
But this matter cannot be rushed.

22:00.000 --> 22:01.520
Otherwise, it'll cause endless trouble.

22:02.480 --> 22:03.760
What else can be done?

22:06.000 --> 22:07.680
Do you not want to marry me?

22:10.280 --> 22:11.760
Your Highness is overthinking it.

22:12.320 --> 22:15.520
Shen Yurong,
I am the Eldest Princess of Great Yan.

22:16.280 --> 22:17.880
I don't care about anything else.

22:17.960 --> 22:18.800
I just want to be

22:18.880 --> 22:21.000
with the person I love
for the rest of my life.

22:22.120 --> 22:25.400
I don't believe I can't get what I want.

22:28.120 --> 22:31.560
So what does Your Highness want me to do?

22:37.040 --> 22:40.960
Joyfully welcome me and our child
to the Shen family.

22:47.320 --> 22:48.160
My lady.

22:49.280 --> 22:51.120
How's the situation
at Eldest Princess' Mansion?

22:51.600 --> 22:53.840
Shen Yurong just went there.

22:56.120 --> 22:57.440
The arrow is strung.

22:58.560 --> 23:00.240
Sure enough, the shot has to be fired.

23:01.280 --> 23:02.800
What do you want me to do next?

23:03.360 --> 23:04.720
Light a fire for them.

23:09.960 --> 23:12.760
GREAT ZHAO IMPERIAL CITY

23:14.680 --> 23:15.560
Drink it.

23:19.440 --> 23:21.320
Why are you so careless?

23:22.520 --> 23:25.040
Great Zhao has really tight security.

23:25.520 --> 23:27.200
Even I got hurt coming in.

23:27.720 --> 23:29.680
Then why didn't you use
the bell I gave you?

23:30.880 --> 23:33.240
How could those soldiers
possibly recognize your bell?

23:33.320 --> 23:34.760
Then you can just tell them

23:35.280 --> 23:36.680
you are Duke Su of Great Yan.

23:36.760 --> 23:38.200
Who would dare to stop you?

23:38.280 --> 23:40.000
I'm visiting in secret.

23:40.080 --> 23:40.920
In secret?

23:44.560 --> 23:47.840
Must you visit me secretly?

23:47.920 --> 23:49.400
I'm here to see your brother.

23:52.480 --> 23:53.880
Whatever, I don't care.

23:54.720 --> 23:56.800
Move along, don't stay here.

23:59.240 --> 24:01.320
I didn't expect Great Zhao's guards
to be so skilled.

24:01.880 --> 24:03.240
If it weren't for Jiuyue's bells,

24:03.320 --> 24:04.720
I'm afraid I would've died.

24:06.040 --> 24:07.120
You must be joking, Duke Su.

24:07.680 --> 24:09.880
With your skills,
if you didn't want to get caught,

24:10.520 --> 24:12.840
it would be hard
for Great Zhao's guards to capture you.

24:13.520 --> 24:14.720
You did this deliberately.

24:14.800 --> 24:16.560
The sooner I am harmed and get caught,

24:17.040 --> 24:18.480
the less conflict would be created,

24:19.720 --> 24:20.960
preventing any misunderstanding.

24:21.440 --> 24:22.280
Tell me.

24:23.920 --> 24:25.600
What do you want from me?

24:26.320 --> 24:27.440
I want an army

24:27.960 --> 24:31.320
to take precautions against possible
rebellious officials and traitors.

24:31.400 --> 24:32.440
Before you came,

24:33.240 --> 24:35.400
Prince Cheng's subordinate
already came to me.

24:35.480 --> 24:37.680
When Prince Cheng
leads an uprising in the north,

24:37.760 --> 24:39.960
Your Majesty only needs
to restrain and hold back

24:40.040 --> 24:41.360
the Great Yan army at your border.

24:41.880 --> 24:44.520
Zhao Ye will be surrounded
and will surely collapse after one strike.

24:45.040 --> 24:47.960
When Prince Cheng becomes the emperor,
he will surely treat Great Zhao well.

24:48.520 --> 24:50.840
Your Majesty just drove away
the rebel forces in your nation.

24:50.920 --> 24:52.560
you must need Great Yan's support.

24:53.200 --> 24:54.760
But if Your Majesty refuses to cooperate

24:55.240 --> 24:57.680
or insists on aiding Zhao Ye
in putting up a stiff resistance,

24:57.760 --> 24:59.440
after Prince Cheng becomes the emperor,

24:59.520 --> 25:02.240
the first thing he'll probably do
is settle the score with you.

25:02.320 --> 25:03.920
Are you threatening me?

25:04.000 --> 25:04.840
I dare not do so.

25:04.920 --> 25:06.800
Prince Cheng is far more powerful
than Zhao Ye.

25:06.880 --> 25:08.960
I just don't want Your Majesty
to make the wrong choice

25:09.040 --> 25:10.800
and ruin the foundation you just laid.

25:10.880 --> 25:12.880
Regarding the Emperor of Great Yan
and Prince Cheng,

25:13.360 --> 25:15.960
my ministers
have carefully discussed and analyzed it.

25:16.760 --> 25:18.720
Only less than half of them think

25:19.520 --> 25:20.840
the Emperor of Great Yan will win.

25:20.920 --> 25:24.240
Duke Su, I hope you can understand.

25:24.800 --> 25:25.960
If I help you,

25:26.800 --> 25:29.000
I won't just be risking the lives
of my family and I,

25:29.840 --> 25:31.800
the fate of Great Zhao is also at stake.

25:32.520 --> 25:34.320
So, no matter who wins,

25:34.400 --> 25:36.520
as long as the victor

25:36.600 --> 25:38.480
is willing to maintain peace
with Great Zhao,

25:39.040 --> 25:40.280
I can accept it.

25:43.520 --> 25:45.200
Your Majesty is waiting for my bid, right?

25:47.240 --> 25:49.440
If Your Majesty feels
that Prince Cheng is sure to win,

25:49.520 --> 25:52.280
you probably would have agreed
to form an alliance with him.

25:54.000 --> 25:54.840
Am I wrong?

25:58.120 --> 25:59.800
This matter only concerns Great Yan.

25:59.880 --> 26:02.160
Great Zhao is a small nation
with no control over the conflict.

26:02.240 --> 26:03.280
If Prince Cheng wins,

26:04.040 --> 26:06.240
our nation will naturally prepare a gift

26:06.320 --> 26:07.440
to congratulate him.

26:07.520 --> 26:09.960
Sending it then and sending it now

26:10.040 --> 26:11.280
are two different situations.

26:12.600 --> 26:16.040
So what does Prince Cheng want from me?

26:16.120 --> 26:18.720
Didn't Your Majesty just form
an alliance with Great Yan?

26:18.800 --> 26:21.200
Zhao Ye naturally thinks
that you are on his side.

26:21.280 --> 26:22.480
Prince Cheng doesn't want much.

26:23.120 --> 26:25.240
As long as you continue
to feed him this illusion,

26:25.320 --> 26:26.880
when Prince Cheng rises to rebellion,

26:26.960 --> 26:29.720
I hope Your Majesty will give us
your support in times of need.

26:29.800 --> 26:31.440
I didn't accept
Prince Cheng's proposition,

26:32.720 --> 26:34.600
but I don't necessarily have
to accept yours.

26:35.880 --> 26:37.000
His Majesty said

26:37.520 --> 26:39.000
that as long as Your Majesty helps us,

26:39.080 --> 26:40.360
you can state your condition.

26:41.080 --> 26:43.560
You are just the icing on the cake
to Prince Cheng.

26:44.200 --> 26:45.160
Even if he wins,

26:45.640 --> 26:47.080
he won't necessarily be grateful.

26:47.160 --> 26:50.200
But to His Majesty,
you are help during a time of need.

26:50.280 --> 26:51.880
He will definitely repay you.

26:51.960 --> 26:53.960
Even if the Emperor of Great Yan wins,

26:54.040 --> 26:57.040
how would I know if he

26:57.520 --> 26:59.840
will fulfill his promise?

26:59.920 --> 27:01.800
Didn't Your Majesty
personally come to our nation

27:01.880 --> 27:02.960
and meet our emperor?

27:03.440 --> 27:04.560
Can't His Majesty's sincerity

27:04.640 --> 27:06.080
obtain your trust in return?

27:06.160 --> 27:07.280
I can't trust him.

27:08.200 --> 27:09.120
However,

27:09.600 --> 27:10.520
I trust you.

27:11.640 --> 27:14.120
It all depends if you're willing
to accept my condition.

27:17.680 --> 27:20.440
Did you hear
that the Eldest Princess is pregnant?

27:20.520 --> 27:23.320
Nonsense. The Eldest Princess
doesn't even have a Prince Consort.

27:23.400 --> 27:24.400
How can she get pregnant?

27:24.480 --> 27:26.120
You're the nonsensical one. Trust me,

27:26.200 --> 27:28.200
the Eldest Princess will have
a Prince Consort soon.

27:28.280 --> 27:30.840
Then who do you think
this future Prince Consort will be?

27:30.920 --> 27:34.160
I once heard that Mr. Shen was seen
going in and out of the Princess' Mansion.

27:34.240 --> 27:35.880
- Do you think it could be him?
- Waiter.

27:35.960 --> 27:37.760
- Coming.
- Just wait and see.

27:37.840 --> 27:38.680
The child

27:38.760 --> 27:40.880
must have a father.

27:41.360 --> 27:42.240
True.

27:42.760 --> 27:45.440
Mother, where is Yurong?

27:46.360 --> 27:48.280
He went to Hanlin Academy
early this morning.

27:48.880 --> 27:50.480
Why are you in such a hurry to see him?

27:50.560 --> 27:52.840
I heard that the Eldest Princess
is pregnant.

27:53.600 --> 27:54.680
Did he tell you about it?

27:56.600 --> 27:57.440
Who told you that?

27:57.520 --> 27:59.480
Everyone on the streets is saying it.

28:02.760 --> 28:03.920
No way.

28:04.000 --> 28:07.000
If it were true,
Yurong would have told us already.

28:07.080 --> 28:08.880
Has Yurong ever taken the initiative

28:08.960 --> 28:10.840
to tell us about him
and the Eldest Princess?

28:12.240 --> 28:15.000
This won't do,
I have to go to Hanlin Academy now

28:15.720 --> 28:17.000
and ask him what's going on.

28:18.720 --> 28:19.600
Your Majesty.

28:19.680 --> 28:23.240
GOVERN PEOPLE, SERVE THE HEAVENS

28:23.320 --> 28:26.560
I heard from Eunuch Su that you
haven't taken your medicine, Your Majesty.

28:28.120 --> 28:30.480
It's getting more and more bitter.
I had a bowl.

28:30.560 --> 28:31.800
I'll set this aside first.

28:31.880 --> 28:34.440
Your Majesty, you caught a cold.

28:34.520 --> 28:36.800
This medicine will cure you
and help you stay healthy.

28:36.880 --> 28:39.040
It's best to take the two bowls at once.

28:39.120 --> 28:40.520
I asked them to reheat it.

28:41.280 --> 28:43.440
Your Majesty, you'd better drink it.

28:43.520 --> 28:46.160
Otherwise, I would worry about you.

28:46.240 --> 28:49.280
You always have many ways
to make me take my medicine.

28:59.400 --> 29:01.960
Your Majesty,
have you heard a rumor recently?

29:03.040 --> 29:03.920
What is it?

29:04.000 --> 29:06.880
I heard that Eldest Princess Wanning
is pregnant.

29:07.440 --> 29:09.120
The rumor has even spread
to the palace now.

29:09.600 --> 29:12.000
Wanning is not married.

29:12.520 --> 29:14.080
How could there be such a rumor?

29:14.160 --> 29:16.200
How can there be such an outrageous rumor?

29:16.280 --> 29:19.280
Yes, this matter affects
the reputation of the imperial family.

29:19.960 --> 29:21.480
Do the people spreading this rumor

29:21.960 --> 29:24.000
intend to harm the imperial family?

29:24.080 --> 29:27.000
What do you think I should do then?

29:27.080 --> 29:29.520
Send an imperial physician
to check Wanning's pulse.

29:30.000 --> 29:31.600
Then the rumors will stop.

29:31.680 --> 29:32.720
Good idea.

29:33.720 --> 29:35.880
However, if an imperial physician
goes there alone,

29:36.600 --> 29:39.360
with Wanning's temperament,
I'm afraid he would be kicked out.

29:40.040 --> 29:43.120
I am willing to go
with the imperial physician

29:43.200 --> 29:44.640
and visit Wanning as well.

29:45.200 --> 29:46.680
Since this rumor came out,

29:47.160 --> 29:48.960
she doesn't come out much anymore.

29:49.480 --> 29:51.760
I haven't seen her for a while too.

29:51.840 --> 29:54.400
All right, I'll have to trouble you then.

29:54.960 --> 29:55.960
It's what I should do.

29:56.880 --> 29:59.160
Hey, listen, the Eldest Princess

29:59.240 --> 30:00.120
seems to be pregnant.

30:01.080 --> 30:03.160
- Whose is it?
- I don't know too. I just heard about it.

30:03.240 --> 30:04.960
Is it true?

30:05.040 --> 30:06.320
It's hard to tell.

30:06.400 --> 30:07.920
I don't think this is true.

30:08.000 --> 30:10.240
When there's smoke, there's fire.

30:10.320 --> 30:12.560
Have you found all the books
I asked you to find?

30:13.600 --> 30:15.040
- We're looking for them.
- We're on it.

30:28.040 --> 30:28.880
Yurong.

30:30.440 --> 30:31.560
Let's speak outside.

30:34.280 --> 30:36.280
- Come.
- Mother, what exactly is this about?

30:36.840 --> 30:38.720
What's going on between you
and the Eldest Princess?

30:38.800 --> 30:40.120
Rumors are spreading everywhere

30:41.040 --> 30:42.520
that the Eldest Princess is pregnant.

30:42.600 --> 30:44.920
Everywhere? What does that mean?

30:45.000 --> 30:47.000
It's all over the streets.

30:49.680 --> 30:53.440
Don't leave yet. Tell me.

30:53.520 --> 30:56.080
What's going on
between you and the Eldest Princess?

30:56.640 --> 30:57.680
Mother, can't you see it?

30:58.440 --> 31:00.200
Since it is known to everyone,

31:00.280 --> 31:02.520
there must be someone behind the scenes.

31:03.240 --> 31:04.520
I'm afraid this is a conspiracy.

31:07.920 --> 31:09.480
I'll find a way to solve it.

31:10.000 --> 31:11.640
Mother, don't cause more trouble.

31:21.360 --> 31:23.040
Greetings, Consort Li.

31:24.280 --> 31:25.600
Eldest Princess.

31:26.160 --> 31:28.080
Why do you have time to come here today?

31:28.160 --> 31:31.160
I've heard some rumors recently,

31:31.240 --> 31:32.640
so I came to check on you.

31:33.680 --> 31:34.880
What rumors?

31:35.440 --> 31:38.480
Some people say that you're pregnant.

31:41.120 --> 31:42.840
Do you believe that, Consort Li?

31:43.760 --> 31:47.440
I don't believe it
and neither does His Majesty.

31:48.400 --> 31:51.160
So I brought an imperial physician
here today

31:51.800 --> 31:52.840
to check on you.

31:54.440 --> 31:55.480
How impetuous.

31:58.080 --> 31:59.920
I can't let you do as you wish to me

32:00.000 --> 32:01.360
just for some rumors.

32:03.040 --> 32:05.680
It's precisely because it's a rumor
that we have to investigate it.

32:06.320 --> 32:08.680
After all, according to the rumors,

32:09.440 --> 32:11.760
the one who spread the word
was your designated physician,

32:11.840 --> 32:12.960
Imperial Physician Zhang.

32:13.520 --> 32:15.560
But no one knows where he is now.

32:16.040 --> 32:17.800
The Imperial Academy of Medicine
is responsible.

32:17.880 --> 32:21.240
As such, they sent
another imperial physician to you.

32:21.320 --> 32:22.240
In my opinion,

32:22.840 --> 32:25.320
whether you are sick or not,
it's good to have them check on you.

32:26.000 --> 32:27.360
Don't the women in the palace

32:27.440 --> 32:29.920
regularly ask for pulse readings
for peace of mind?

32:30.000 --> 32:31.480
Although you don't live in the palace,

32:32.240 --> 32:35.000
you should also take care of yourself.

32:38.000 --> 32:40.680
How dare that old man
spread rumors about me?

32:40.760 --> 32:43.480
When I find him,
I'll tear his mouth apart.

32:46.080 --> 32:48.240
The Imperial Academy of Medicine
is also looking for him.

32:48.760 --> 32:51.400
It's a pity that even his residence
has been emptied.

32:52.200 --> 32:53.880
If he still can't be found,

32:55.000 --> 32:56.640
they will naturally link him to you.

32:57.200 --> 33:01.760
That old man must have absconded
with his family.

33:03.280 --> 33:05.280
Your Highness, you must not tolerate that.

33:05.760 --> 33:07.560
I thought so too at first,

33:08.880 --> 33:11.640
but I didn't expect to hear another rumor.

33:11.720 --> 33:13.640
They say Imperial Physician Zhang

33:13.720 --> 33:17.120
might have found out some secret and was--

33:17.200 --> 33:18.960
Which shameless person said that?

33:19.040 --> 33:20.320
He should confront me.

33:23.400 --> 33:26.680
I also wanted to catch the person
who spread the rumors.

33:26.760 --> 33:28.920
But on second thought,

33:29.000 --> 33:32.320
if we arrest him, it would look like
the imperial family is guilty.

33:32.880 --> 33:34.640
After mulling it over,

33:34.720 --> 33:37.040
I think it's better for us to openly

33:37.120 --> 33:38.600
put the rumors to rest.

33:39.520 --> 33:41.440
Don't you think so, Wanning?

33:42.600 --> 33:46.840
Imperial Physician Chu,
check the Eldest Princess's pulse.

33:46.920 --> 33:48.360
Yes, Your Highness.

33:49.880 --> 33:51.680
Your Highness, kindly allow me.

33:53.640 --> 33:55.600
Eldest Princess, what are you doing?

33:56.160 --> 33:59.560
I am the Eldest Princess.
My body is precious.

33:59.640 --> 34:01.520
Why should I be forced
to prove my innocence

34:02.320 --> 34:04.040
just because of some rumors?

34:04.600 --> 34:07.040
You're humiliating me.

34:07.120 --> 34:08.320
If that's the case,

34:09.199 --> 34:12.080
I will go back and report this
to His Majesty.

34:12.639 --> 34:16.679
Eldest Princess, just wait for His Majesty
to personally give the edict.

34:17.280 --> 34:18.440
You may all go.

34:19.159 --> 34:21.320
I want to talk to Consort Li alone.

34:30.600 --> 34:32.000
Consort Li.

34:32.080 --> 34:34.280
You are so forgetful.

34:35.440 --> 34:37.719
Have you forgotten about Consort Xian?

34:38.199 --> 34:40.280
Before threatening others,

34:41.080 --> 34:44.360
why don't you check
who you have in your hands?

34:45.080 --> 34:46.080
What do you mean?

34:47.600 --> 34:49.280
You're so smart.

34:49.360 --> 34:51.080
Do you need me to remind you?

34:51.800 --> 34:53.920
Do you want to side with Xue Fangfei?

34:54.000 --> 34:55.560
I don't want to take either side.

34:55.639 --> 34:56.760
I don't like you both.

34:57.760 --> 34:59.080
Ever since my sister became sick,

34:59.880 --> 35:02.800
I am no longer as competitive as before.

35:04.160 --> 35:06.880
It was you who forced my hand first.

35:08.280 --> 35:09.120
I

35:09.760 --> 35:11.440
hate being threatened the most.

35:12.680 --> 35:15.680
All right, that's it for today.

35:16.640 --> 35:19.680
When I get back,
I will report this to His Majesty.

35:20.440 --> 35:23.320
Take care, Eldest Princess.

35:24.200 --> 35:27.560
When you are free, think about

35:27.640 --> 35:29.640
how you'll explain to His Majesty

35:31.200 --> 35:33.360
where this child in your belly came from.

35:57.680 --> 35:59.480
Your Highness, Mr. Shen is here.

36:12.640 --> 36:13.600
You're finally here.

36:13.680 --> 36:15.640
- Come with me to see His Majesty.
- See His Majesty?

36:16.160 --> 36:17.680
That's the last thing we should do now.

36:17.760 --> 36:18.760
Why?

36:19.280 --> 36:20.880
Do you know that Consort Li just came by?

36:20.960 --> 36:22.400
Do you know how she threatened me?

36:22.480 --> 36:23.320
Consort Li?

36:23.400 --> 36:24.600
By now, the Emperor should know

36:24.680 --> 36:25.600
that I'm pregnant.

36:25.680 --> 36:28.480
If you don't become my Prince Consort,
how will I explain who the father

36:29.000 --> 36:30.280
of this child is?

36:30.840 --> 36:31.720
Consort Li?

36:32.440 --> 36:34.160
Isn't she on Your Highness's side?

36:34.240 --> 36:36.640
What do you care about Consort Li?
She is just a dog.

36:36.720 --> 36:38.400
She will side
with whoever gives her a bone.

36:39.280 --> 36:40.600
At this point, what…

36:40.680 --> 36:42.160
What are you hesitating about?

36:42.240 --> 36:43.480
What do you want?

36:44.680 --> 36:46.480
Doesn't Your Highness
think something is fishy?

36:47.120 --> 36:48.280
Lately, it feels as if someone

36:48.960 --> 36:51.360
is pulling the strings
behind the scenes with what's happening.

36:52.760 --> 36:53.600
What do you mean?

36:53.680 --> 36:56.960
The news of Your Highness's pregnancy
was leaked immediately.

36:57.840 --> 36:59.280
It spread from the streets

36:59.880 --> 37:01.320
and even reached the Imperial Court.

37:01.960 --> 37:04.320
Later on, Consort Li brought
an imperial physician here

37:04.400 --> 37:05.880
in the name of clearing up the rumor.

37:05.960 --> 37:07.880
If no one is behind all this,

37:08.760 --> 37:10.640
how could everything develop so fast?

37:11.960 --> 37:12.800
Who did it?

37:13.760 --> 37:16.240
Consort Li? Xue Fangfei?

37:17.440 --> 37:18.280
Or Xiao Heng?

37:18.840 --> 37:20.960
Are they in cahoots?
What are they trying to do?

37:21.040 --> 37:22.440
Your Highness, please calm down a bit.

37:22.520 --> 37:23.680
No matter who is behind this,

37:24.680 --> 37:26.400
we just need
to figure out their intentions

37:27.000 --> 37:28.320
to be free from their control.

37:28.400 --> 37:30.200
What do you think their intentions are?

37:31.000 --> 37:32.760
I think they want us

37:32.840 --> 37:34.440
to admit our relationship

37:35.640 --> 37:37.800
and use it to accuse you and me
of having an affair.

37:38.600 --> 37:40.160
They're plotting to disgrace both of us,

37:40.240 --> 37:42.920
so they can investigate
the Xue family murder case.

37:43.000 --> 37:44.160
They can't get to the bottom

37:44.240 --> 37:45.720
of the Xue family's case so easily.

37:45.800 --> 37:46.800
Why should we care?

37:46.880 --> 37:49.240
The Xue family's case is insignificant,
but what about Prince Cheng?

37:49.960 --> 37:51.960
Prince Cheng will soon arrive
in the capital.

37:52.040 --> 37:53.440
At this critical moment,

37:53.960 --> 37:55.920
if something happens
to Your Highness right now,

37:56.000 --> 37:57.560
we'll be giving people
a hold on Prince Cheng.

37:58.520 --> 37:59.480
My brother.

38:00.040 --> 38:02.840
When Prince Cheng succeeds
and becomes the emperor,

38:04.040 --> 38:06.520
no one can question our relationship.

38:08.160 --> 38:11.120
The two of us can have many more children.

38:11.720 --> 38:12.840
Shen Yurong!

38:13.360 --> 38:14.640
Do you know

38:16.760 --> 38:18.000
how difficult it is for me

38:19.360 --> 38:21.600
to get pregnant with this child?

38:22.720 --> 38:24.680
I'm telling you,
even if we must both sacrifice,

38:24.760 --> 38:25.760
I must keep him!

38:27.160 --> 38:30.680
If so, is Your Highness willing
to be aggrieved?

38:31.240 --> 38:32.560
Do you have a way to keep him?

38:33.840 --> 38:34.680
Promise me.

38:35.960 --> 38:36.800
There is a way.

38:38.120 --> 38:39.040
But Wanning,

38:40.120 --> 38:41.280
I don't want you to do it.

38:42.360 --> 38:44.000
What kind of grievance will I suffer?

38:44.600 --> 38:48.040
The father of this child can only be…

38:49.880 --> 38:50.720
Li Jin.

38:59.680 --> 39:00.680
What did you say?

39:02.520 --> 39:04.440
This is the only way to keep the child.

39:05.240 --> 39:07.360
This is your child, Shen Yurong.

39:07.440 --> 39:09.960
I understand, but to keep this child,

39:10.760 --> 39:13.000
we must make people believe
that there is a reasonable father.

39:13.760 --> 39:15.160
In the entire Imperial Court,

39:15.840 --> 39:17.240
the only one who matches your status

39:17.760 --> 39:19.400
and is willing to listen to Your Highness

39:20.280 --> 39:21.600
is Chancellor Li.

39:22.440 --> 39:23.640
The Li family has two sons.

39:24.120 --> 39:26.840
Li Lian became a monk.
Li Jin is unmarried.

39:26.920 --> 39:28.400
He is the best candidate.

39:28.480 --> 39:31.120
That's the only place
where you can safely have your pregnancy.

39:32.040 --> 39:33.160
For the sake of our child,

39:34.360 --> 39:35.720
let's bear with this for a while.

39:36.720 --> 39:37.760
After the child is born,

39:38.560 --> 39:40.520
I'm sure Prince Cheng
would have already succeeded.

39:41.240 --> 39:44.640
By then, you can just
find a reason to divorce him.

39:45.560 --> 39:47.280
We can still be together.

39:47.840 --> 39:50.560
In this way, the ones
who want to destroy us

39:51.520 --> 39:52.800
won't have a chance to do so.

39:57.640 --> 39:58.720
Shen Yurong.

40:03.240 --> 40:04.520
You said these things

40:06.880 --> 40:08.600
since you don't want
to be my Prince Consort,

40:10.520 --> 40:11.440
right?

40:12.000 --> 40:13.440
It's not a pity for me to die.

40:14.560 --> 40:15.920
I will be with Your Highness

40:16.400 --> 40:17.960
in whatever you choose to do.

40:20.040 --> 40:21.000
Don't touch me.

40:24.520 --> 40:25.880
Don't touch me!

40:41.600 --> 40:42.840
You are forcing me to do this.

40:48.840 --> 40:50.040
You know it.

40:54.360 --> 40:57.360
You know everything.

41:07.280 --> 41:08.440
Father, you mean

41:08.960 --> 41:11.120
you want me to be
the Eldest Princess' Prince Consort?

41:12.360 --> 41:13.640
Is there a problem?

41:14.200 --> 41:15.440
Have you heard

41:15.520 --> 41:17.160
the rumors about the Eldest Princess?

41:18.360 --> 41:19.200
A little.

41:19.800 --> 41:22.480
The Li family isn't some humble family.

41:22.560 --> 41:24.800
How can a child of unknown origin

41:24.880 --> 41:26.600
be the first grandchild of the Li family?

41:26.680 --> 41:29.120
I know this is not easy for you.

41:30.240 --> 41:32.840
But this is also an opportunity for you
to make amends.

41:35.760 --> 41:39.720
The Eldest Princess' backer
is Prince Cheng.

41:39.800 --> 41:40.840
Father, have you thought about this?

41:40.920 --> 41:42.280
If the child is born, all is well.

41:42.360 --> 41:44.760
But if something happens to it
in the Li family,

41:44.840 --> 41:46.640
I'm afraid all of us will be implicated!

41:47.440 --> 41:50.360
Of course I know what is at stake.

41:50.440 --> 41:52.240
But this is the will
of the Eldest Princess.

41:52.320 --> 41:54.480
The Li family can't refuse it.

41:55.560 --> 41:59.040
Jin'er, if the Eldest Princess
can marry into our family,

41:59.680 --> 42:02.320
it will be beneficial to our alliance
with Prince Cheng.

42:04.920 --> 42:06.800
You are a smart person.

42:07.360 --> 42:09.520
You should understand why we must do this.

42:23.320 --> 42:25.680
My lady, I just heard from a servant

42:26.240 --> 42:28.600
that the Eldest Princess is going
to marry into the Li family.

42:31.480 --> 42:32.320
The Li family?

42:33.520 --> 42:34.760
Really?

42:34.840 --> 42:36.640
How about I go to the market
and ask around?

42:36.720 --> 42:37.560
All right.

42:41.440 --> 42:43.160
Nice one, Shen Yurong.

42:45.480 --> 42:47.840
I have underestimated your cunningness.
